		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I had the great joy of meeting Shamcher at a camp in Ontario, Canada.  His eyes were the bluest blue and when he was in a &#8220;state of blessed bliss, the blue became even deeper.  One day as we passed one another going to the wash house, he gifted me with the glance of the lover for the beloved&#8230;it was so overwhelming that it was easy for me to play the role of the Beloved and to cast my eyes to the earth.  What a treasure.</p>
